          <xs:sequence>
            <xs:element name="starting_timecode" type="xs:string" default="off" minOccurs="0">
              <xs:annotation>
                <xs:documentation>
                  Starting embedded timecode (HH:MM:SS:FF or HH:MM:SS.xx) of the output file.
                  'auto': the timecodes will start at the input start point.
                  'off': the timecodes will not be embedded in the encoded stream.
